config OPENCECS_LIFECYCLE_EMERGENCY
 bool "OpenCecs PID1-only explicit emergency restart"
 depends on ARM64 && ARCH_CIX && ARM_PSCI_FW
 depends on PLAT_REBOOT_REASON && SKY1_REBOOT_REASON
 default n
 help
   Built-in private emergency restart entry for OpenCecs PID1. Bypasses
   blocking reboot notifiers, device shutdown and the global reboot mutex.
   Only explicit acknowledged emergency operations are accepted. Ordinary
   reboot(2) is unchanged. Hardware/firmware hard locks may still prevent reset.
